<title>AUSTRALIA: BHP to buy eight GE locomotives.</title>
<headline>BHP to buy eight GE locomotives.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd said on Friday  it had ordered eight General Electric Co. AC6000 locomotives and 231  iron ore cars in a series of contracts worth just under A$70 million.</p>
<p>The contracts have been let to Howard Smith Ltd's rail engineering  unit A. Goninan &amp; Co Ltd in Perth, BHP said.</p>
</text>
